  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & {\\mathrm{A}(3, \\alpha, 3) \\& B(-3,-7, \\beta)} \\\\ & \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{BA}}=6 \\hat{\\mathrm{i}}+(\\alpha+7) \\hat{\\mathrm{j}}+(3-\\beta) \\hat{\\mathrm{k}} \\\\ \\end{aligned}$<br/>$\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{p}} \\times \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{q}}=\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}\\hat{\\mathrm{i}} & \\hat{\\mathrm{j}} & \\hat{\\mathrm{k}} \\\\ 3 & -1 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 2 & 4\\end{array}\\right|$<br/>$\\frac{|\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{BA}} \\cdot(\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{p}} \\times \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{q}})|}{|\\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{p}} \\times \\overrightarrow{\\mathrm{q}}|}=3 \\sqrt{30}$<br/>$36+15(\\alpha+7)-3(3-\\beta)=(3 \\sqrt{30})^2$<br/>$\\begin{aligned} & 36+15 \\alpha+105-9+3 \\beta=270 \\\\ & 15 \\alpha+3 \\beta=138 \\\\ & 5 \\alpha+\\beta=46\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
